# 5. Database Schema

## Users Collection

| Field     | Type     | Required |
| --------- | -------- | -------- |
| _id       | ObjectId | Yes      |
| name      | String   | Yes      |
| email     | String   | Yes      |
| password  | String   | Yes      |
| avatar    | String   | No       |
| createdAt | Date     | Yes      |

---

## LibraryItems Collection

| Field            | Type       |
| ---------------- | ---------- |
| _id              | ObjectId   |
| type             | Movie/Book |
| title            | String     |
| genre            | String     |
| authorOrDirector | String     |
| description      | String     |
| poster           | String     |
| rating           | Number     |
| releaseYear      | Number     |
| status           | String     |
| favorite         | Boolean    |
| tags             | Array      |
| createdBy        | ObjectId   |
| createdAt        | Date       |
| updatedAt        | Date       |

---

# 6. Authentication Flow

```text
Register

↓

Hash Password

↓

Store User

↓

Login

↓

Verify Password

↓

Generate JWT

↓

Send Token

↓

Protected Routes

↓

Authenticated User
```

