# 18. Security

* JWT Authentication
* Password Hashing (bcrypt)
* Protected Routes
* Input Validation
* Server-side Validation
* MongoDB Injection Protection
* CORS Configuration
* Environment Variables
* Secure Password Storage

---

# 19. Validation Rules

Title

Required

Maximum 100 characters

---

Genre

Required

---

Rating

1–5

---

Release Year

1900–Current Year

---

Poster

Image only

---

Email

Valid Email

---

Password

Minimum 8 characters

